# Neeti PRD

[docs/PRD.md](../../docs/PRD.md) is the source of truth for what Neeti is.

- Read it before proposing or writing implementation.
- Do not add a reasoner, a solver, a knowledge formalism, a language model, or dependencies until an issue asks for them.
- Knowledge is the source of truth. Every answer carries a derivation a person can follow by hand. "Unknown" is a valid answer; guessing is not.
- Inviolable rules cannot be overridden by any fact, rule, or model output.
